<title>USA: Woodward Governor cuts 50 jobs.</title>
<headline>Woodward Governor cuts 50 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodward Governor Co's Industrial Controls group said Thursday it cut about 50 jobs at its Engine Controls and Turbomachinery Controls business units in Colorado.</p>
<p>The job cuts, mainly in engineering, sales and administrative areas, are the result of a recent consolidation of the two units, the company said.  </p>
<p>&quot;These consolidations and the corresponding cost reductions are an important part of our ongoing efforts to improve the business group's competitive position in its industrial markets, which are characterized by stiff price pressures, demanding quality levels and continuous product improvement,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Woodward Govenor has more than 3,200 employees worldwide.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
